  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Tecnolgico II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technology Development Program II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Contribuir a movilizar el potencial de ciencia, tecnologa e innovacin del Prestatario para fortalecer la competitividad productiva, principalmente de las pequeas y medianas empresas (PYMES), y mejorar la capacidad de desarrollo cientfico y tecnolgico de investigadores y cientficos uruguayos.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to mobilize the science, technology and innovation potential of the Borrower to strengthen the productive competitiveness, mainly of the small and medium companies (SME), and to improve the capacity of scientific and technological development of Uruguayan researchers and scientists.</narrative>
  </description>
